Hi Matt,

JA is the "young adults" category. I'm working on a validation of an eating self-efficacy scale. The EFA showed a two factors, 12 items structure that I want to confirm in each of the three age categories.

Here is the code:

model.SPE<-'
F1=~AE13+AE3+AE7+AE8+AE12+AE18+AE20
F2=~AE1+AE6+AE11+AE16+AE19'

