That is a lot of syntax. The first thing that jumps out at me. This part does *not* set unique variances equal:

# Some further constraints on the variance structure
# 1. Set error variances of the observed variables to the same value

x1 ~~ x1
x2 ~~ x2
x3 ~~ x3
x4 ~~ x4
y1 ~~ y1
y2 ~~ y2
y3 ~~ y3
y4 ~~ y4

To make unique variances equal, use the same label for each ofthese parameters, as in:
x1 ~~ v * x1
x2 ~~ v * x2
x3 ~~ v * x3
etc.

