Subject: Re: categorical variables: lavaan and Mplus
Message-ID: <Yk9C3oDnCmo.7piJYw2QDwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Yk9C3oDnCmo.k0SNumY8EgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
